{"title": "通则康威中签号出炉 共35356个", "link": "https://www.stcn.com/article/detail/4213285.html", "pubDate": "2026-10-13T05:24:27+08:00", "description": "人民财讯10月12日电，通则康威(301718)10月12日披露中签结果，中签号码共有35356个，每个中签号码只能认购500股通则康威股票。", "image": "https://static-web.stcn.com/static/images/zqsb.png", "sourceId": "stcn", "sourceName": "证券时报", "sourceFull": "证券时报", "paywall": false, "articleId": "a36"}